# build outputs
/bin/
*.o
# `go build ./cmd/gate` writes ./gate rather than into bin/, and a blanket
# `git add -A` tracked 5.5MB of it once. The Makefile builds into bin/; these are
# the ad-hoc ones.
/gate
/demo
/ingress-verify
/contained-run
/seal-tool
/log-verify
/drive
/dossier
/keygen
/bundle-sign
/arazu-env
/mutation-test
# cmd/corpus is deliberately absent: a tracked corpus/ directory already holds
# that name, so `go build ./cmd/corpus` refuses rather than writing a binary,
# and /corpus here would ignore 75 tracked files.
bpf/vmlinux.h
bpf/*.bpf.o

# compiled python from the corpus helpers; six .pyc files were tracked and
# shipped in the archive, and they are version- and machine-specific.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# generated fixtures (produced by scripts/make-bundle.sh and make-adversarial.sh)
testdata/bundles/

# runtime state (last-accepted version, audit logs, unsealed material)
state/

# secret keys are fixtures for the spike and ARE committed under testdata/keys/
# (deterministic test keys, not production material) — nothing to ignore there

# run artifacts: everything below is produced by re-running a harness, and the
# reasoning that cannot be re-derived lives in the hand-written .yaml and .md
# files beside them, which ARE tracked.
logs/
corpus/reports/*.jsonl
corpus/reports/*.log
corpus/reports/runs/
corpus/reports/m1-decisions/
corpus/reports/m1-regrade/
corpus/reports/candidates/
corpus/reports/asan/
# judge-arm.sh writes per-run prompts and responses to reports/judge/<case>/;
# one case of four models left 964K untracked. The judge-arm-*.md and
# judge-arm-*.yaml evidence files beside it stay tracked, which is why this
# is the directory and not a glob.
corpus/reports/judge/
corpus/reports/matrix*.json
corpus/reports/grader-calibration.json
corpus/reports/m0-nginx.json

# mkosi build outputs. These were tracked, and the three selfcheck artifacts
# alone were 464MB of the 466MB export tarball. They are rebuilt by
# `mkosi --force build` in ci/uki and belong on a stick, not in history.
ci/uki/arazu-*.efi
ci/uki/arazu-*.initrd
ci/uki/arazu-*.vmlinuz
ci/uki/arazu-selfcheck
ci/uki/arazu-coldrun
drafts/email-*.md

# local notes, research and the competition submission. never upstream.
notes/
